}, {"t": 6.72, "txt": "when a signal drops, how to read it,"}, {"t": 9.24, "txt": "how to place it in your broker app,"}, {"t": 11.06, "txt": "and how to manage it like a professional."}, {"t": 13.7, "txt": "Grab your phone, let's do this together."}, {"t": 17.14, "txt": "First, let's read the signal."}, {"t": 19.64, "txt": "Every signal has the same anatomy,"}, {"t": 22.06, "txt": "the direction and the instrument."}, {"t": 24.16, "txt": "Here, it's a cell on gold."}, {"t": 26.86, "txt": "The entry price, where the trade starts,"}, {"t": 30.26, "txt": "the stop loss, your protection."}, {"t": 33.18, "txt": "This is where the trade is simply wrong."}, {"t": 36.02, "txt": "And four take profit levels,"}, {"t": 38.22, "txt": "where we lock in profits step by step."}, {"t": 41.34, "txt": "And the golden rule right in the message,"}, {"t": 43.86, "txt": "one to 3% risk per trade, maximum, no exceptions."}, {"t": 50.32, "txt": "Step two, open your broker app"}, {"t": 52.72, "txt": "and find the instrument from the signal."}, {"t": 55.58, "txt": "Tap the symbol, open the chart,"}, {"t": 57.96, "txt": "and take three seconds to check"}, {"t": 59.6, "txt": "where the price is compared to the entry."}, {"t": 62.26, "txt": "If it's already way past the entry, you let this one go."}, {"t": 66.04, "txt": "There's always a next signal."}, {"t": 68.4, "txt": "Step three, the order."}, {"t": 71.38, "txt": "We tap sell, and now the most important field of all,"}, {"t": 75.5, "txt": "the lot size."}, {"t": 77.16, "txt": "This is where your one to 3% rule becomes a number."}, {"t": 81.68, "txt": "Small account?"}, {"t": 82.88, "txt": "Start with 0.01, a micro lot."}, {"t": 87.08, "txt": "The size is calculated so that if the stop loss gets hit,"}, {"t": 90.7, "txt": "you lose one to 3% of your account, not more."}, {"t": 95.82, "txt": "Step four, type in the stop loss and take profit."}, {"t": 99.98, "txt": "Exactly the numbers from the signal."}, {"t": 102.44, "txt": "Not your feeling, not roughly, exactly."}, {"t": 106.4, "txt": "The stop loss is not optional."}, {"t": 108.68, "txt": "It goes in before you confirm the trade."}, {"t": 112.0, "txt": "A position without a stop loss is not a trade."}, {"t": 115.08, "txt": "It's a hope with a deposit."}, {"t": 117.5, "txt": "Now we confirm and check the chart."}, {"t": 120.2, "txt": "You should see your position line,"}, {"t": 121.96, "txt": "the red stop loss line above,"}, {"t": 124.06, "txt": "and the take profit line below."}, {"t": 126.3, "txt": "If those lines are on the chart, you're done."}, {"t": 129.22, "txt": "No staring, no refreshing every minute."}, {"t": 132.26, "txt": "The trade manages itself now."}, {"t": 135.2, "txt": "And when take profit one gets hit,"}, {"t": 136.72, "txt": "the channel posts it,"}, {"t": 138.96, "txt": "and this is where professionals cash flow."}, {"t": 141.62, "txt": "Close a part of the position at TP1,"}, {"t": 144.38, "txt": "move on to TP2 with the rest."}, {"t": 147.34, "txt": "And the one thing you never do?"}, {"t": 149.7, "txt": "You never, ever move your stop loss further away."}, {"t": 153.94, "txt": "That single habit is what separates accounts"}, {"t": 156.26, "txt": "that grow from accounts that vanish."}, {"t": 159.86, "txt": "That's the whole workflow."}, {"t": 161.98, "txt": "Read the signal, check the entry, size by risk,"}, {"t": 165.66, "txt": "set stop and targets,"}, {"t": 167.12, "txt": "confirm and let it play out."}, {"t": 170.2, "txt": "Simple, repeatable, boring."}, {"t": 174.08, "txt": "And that's exactly why it works."}, {"t": 177.02, "txt": "See you in the channel."}]}